# Text is LF in the repository and in every checkout, on every platform. The
# app and its tools write LF; CRLF checkouts on Windows mixed the two, which
# broke the tracker's byte-identical round trip and filled git output with
# line-ending warnings.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Rendered documents and images are never text.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
